			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4109701">
									

<p>Chosen cliche: Compulsion effect that makes you do bad things/kills you.</p>
<p>The compulsion here is to lie about the existence of the object as best as you can, treating it like an inside joke.</p>
<p>Also for Bright's first challenge.</p>
<p>Also for a challenge Peppers proposed on a discord to introduce something before the conprocs which has diegetic significance.</p>
<p>Originally this was literally a gaslit lamp, but that was too obvious and also you can't stab people with a lantern.</p>

