			<div class="content" id="post-content-4110712">
									

<p>But you <em>can</em> <strong>BuRn ThEm</strong> &#8230;</p>
<p>The Jackass level of commitment to the prank it inspires is quite impressive. Shame the researcher didn't realise that it was the knife causing that. Or try to destroy it (&#8230;with potential The Cat Came Back / Wile E Coyote type shenanigans developing from the attempt(s), played absolutely straight)</p>
<p>Also, the number of (0)55's in this, deliberate as another layer of in-joke, or accidental / subconscious? And is the year meant to be 2055? NB seeing as the actual locker number is given multiple times in the body text, maybe worth putting &quot;in standard anomalous item storage locker P-9055&quot; as the crossed-out containment location rather than &quot;a standard anomalous item storage locker&quot;?</p>

